  <justification>
    <existing>notes/reuse-scan.md row "Playbook list": IPlaybookService behind ListUserPlaybooks/ListPublicPlaybooks; legacy de-duplication in AgentEndpoints (deleted by 001).</existing>
    <extension>The service is reused unchanged; the tool is a thin adapter that unions two existing calls.</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>Copilot users cannot discover which playbooks they may run, so spaarke_run_playbook (030) has no discoverable ids (FR-04 fails).</cost-of-doing-nothing>
  </justification>

