  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">The tool's ids equal the set union of the two REST lists for the same caller.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: a playbook in both lists appears once.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: no caller context returns UserContextRequired.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Model-visible text has no definition JSON or prompt text; result under 64 KiB at the maximum.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">ArchTests and conformance pass; publish-size delta recorded; no new HIGH CVE.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Test scope: cover the stated contract plus the edge cases named in these criteria; anything beyond that needs a one-line justification in the task notes.</criterion>
